  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 801.05 Reuse of Pesticide Containers. No pesticide container shall be re-used for any other purpose except as provided on the manufacturers label.\n\nSource. #5127, eff 4-29-91; ss by #6317, eff 8-13-96; ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04, EXPIRED: 1-3-12\n\nNew. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14\n\nNew. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #13981, eff 5-31-24",
